body:
I think it's good style to always initialize trivial fields of structures or make sure they are initialized in all constructors:

```suggestion
	struct CodePos {
		int line = 0;
		int column = 0;
	};
```

or

```suggestion
	struct CodePos {
		int line;
		int column;

		CodePos() :
				line(0), column(0) {}
		CodePos(int p_line, int p_column) :
				line(p_line), column(p_column) {}
	};
```

